1. PREAMBLE & INTENT
This License is designed for open-source macroeconomic frameworks, autonomous state-space control engines, and public telemetry systems. The objective of this License is to guarantee that algorithmic policy models remain publicly auditable, mathematically immutable, non-discriminatory, and resistant to central political or corporate capture.

